-- transport in a line of Glue types (the sides under the line's binder). The point is taken to
-- the base at the start; carried along the base line, with, on each face that holds along the
-- whole line, the point carried in that side's types and mapped across; then, on each face that
-- holds at the end, the equivalence there gives a point of the side's type over it and a path
-- to its image, and the base is corrected along those paths
nk-tg-sides1 : NkTm → NkTm → NkTm → NkTm
nk-tg-sides1 psi u0 (nk-cons b r) = nk-cons (nk-br (nk-delta b) (nk-lam (nk-app (nk-p1 (nk-app (nk-up (nk-el b)) (nk-var #0))) (nk-app (nk-up (nk-tfill (nk-tl b) psi u0)) (nk-var #0))))) (nk-tg-sides1 psi u0 r)
nk-tg-sides1 psi u0 t = nk-nil
